cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Forecastle or its live-round dataset, please cite it as below.
title: "Forecastle: a daily forecasting game and live benchmark of players against a forecasting model"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jawad
    given-names: Intesar
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/intesarjawad/forecastle"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/intesarjawad/forecastle"
abstract: >-
  Forecastle is a daily browser game in which players draw the next seven days of a real chart and
  are scored against a forecasting model that saw the same history. The live rounds are published
  as a dataset in the fev layout, with a data card that lists the known biases of the comparison.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - time series
  - benchmark
  - fev
